## 👩‍💻 About Me

I am a **React Native Developer** with **1+ year of hands-on experience** in building high-performance mobile applications for Android and iOS. I specialize in JavaScript, TypeScript, React Native, and REST API integration, with a strong focus on clean code, reusable components, and smooth UI/UX.

- 🔭 I’m currently working on building seamless **Mobile Experiences**.
- 🌱 I’m currently learning **Advanced Animations** & **System Design**.
- 📍 Based in **Rajkot, Gujarat, India**.
- 💬 Ask me about **React Native, TypeScript, & Mobile UI/UX**.

